By the identity $\cot \theta = \frac{\cos \theta}{\sin \theta},$ we have
\[\cot 120^\circ = \frac{\cos 120^\circ}{\sin 120^\circ}.\]Since $\cos 120^\circ = -\frac{1}{2}$ and $\sin 120^\circ = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2},$ we get
